    emmo:elucidation "quotient of the rms value of the electric current in a two-terminal element or a two-terminal circuit by the rms value of the voltage between its terminals."@en ;
    emmo:note "Apparent admittance is often denoted by Y ."@en ;
    emmo:qudtReference "https://qudt.org/vocab/quantitykind/ModulusOfAdmittance"^^xsd:string ;
    emmo:wikidataReference "https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q79466359"^^xsd:string .

