    skos:prefLabel "HyperfineTransitionFrequencyOfCs"@en ;
    emmo:elucidation """The frequency standard in the SI system in which the photon absorption by transitions between the two hyperfine ground states of caesium-133 atoms are used to control the output frequency.

It defines the base unit second in the SI system."""@en .

