    rdfs:subClassOf emmo:EMMO_e2b11f6a_4191_427e_9844_2e0ac88dfc8b ;
    skos:prefLabel "OrganicCompound"@en ;
    emmo:elucidation """A chemical compound containing carbon atoms.

-- IUPAC"""@en ;
    emmo:note "The definition of organic compound is based on the IUPAC Gold Book. However, sometimes an organic compound is defined as a chemical compound that contains a carbon–hydrogen or carbon–carbon bond. Also, some carbon-containing compounds are typically not classified as organic, like carbides, carbonates, and cyanides."@en .

