        "CuttingManufacturing"@en ;
    skos:prefLabel "SeparateManufacturing"@en ;
    emmo:elucidation "A manufacturing process in which the shape of a workpiece is changed by breaking the material cohesion at the processing point and thus the material cohesion is reduced overall."@en .

